# Python bytecode from running the agent-layer harnesses locally
# (agent/castle-modal imports agent/castle as a module, which writes
# one). Never belongs in the repo: it is a build artifact of a
# specific interpreter version, and modules/agent's castleCli
# derivation takes agent/ as its src, so a stray .pyc changes a store
# path for nothing.
__pycache__/
